WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Hi, and welcome to Montreonto Toronto. I'm your concierge.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Here's a little secret.

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.900
Most hotels hand every guest the same list of restaurants.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.900
We don't.

5
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.500
Tell us two or three things you love.

6
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.700
A band, a show, a brand you always wear.

7
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.800
That's all.

8
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.500
Before you arrive, I'll take our house list and edit it just for you.

9
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:20.300
Some places get crossed out.

10
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.600
New ones get written in, each with a short note on why we think it fits your taste.

11
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.000
It's right here on your phone.

12
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.300
Tap any place, and it opens in Maps.

13
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.800
And when the sun goes down, there's a second list. For after dark.

14
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.900
Of course, you can always come and talk to me at the desk.

15
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.600
But I have a feeling you'll like what's on your list.

16
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:39.900
See you in Toronto.

